meta {
  name: Assign Roles to User
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/rbac/users/:userId/roles
  body: json
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  userId: {{userId}}
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "roleIds": [
      "uuid-role-1",
      "uuid-role-2"
    ]
  }
}

docs {
  # Assign Roles to User
  
  Mengganti/assign roles untuk user tertentu.
  Roles sebelumnya akan dihapus dan diganti dengan roles baru.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Description |
  |-----------|------|-------------|
  | userId | UUID | ID user yang akan di-assign roles |
  
  ## Request Body
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | roleIds | UUID[] | Yes | Array of role IDs untuk di-assign |
  
  ## Response (Success)
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengassign roles ke user",
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "username": "user123",
      "name": "User Name",
      "roles": [
        {
          "id": "uuid-role-1",
          "name": "dosen"
        },
        {
          "id": "uuid-role-2",
          "name": "kaprodi"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Error Response
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "User tidak ditemukan",
    "error": "Not Found"
  }
  ```
  
  ## Permission Required
  
  - `assign_roles`
  
  ## CSRF Protection
  
  Request ini membutuhkan CSRF token di header `X-CSRF-Token`.
  Token dapat diambil dari cookie `XSRF-TOKEN`.
}
